# Harvest a planter only while the pantry is low, so ripe food keeps on the plant.
# d0: a planter box, farm tile or hydroponic farm. d1: a refrigerator or ration box.
alias planter d0
alias pantry d1
define low 20            # kilograms
loop:
s planter AutoHarvest 0  # the plant is new after each harvest, so say it every tick
ls r0 planter 0 Mature   # 1 ripe, 0 growing, -1 no plant
l r1 pantry Quantity
slt r2 r1 low
sgtz r0 r0
and r3 r0 r2
s planter Harvest r3
yield
j loop
